          "message": {
            "text": "PHP PQC algorithm or X-Wing reference; runtime support requires verification. | migration_hint=Verify the specific Sodium or ParagonIE implementation and version. X-Wing is distinct from standalone ML-KEM and TLS hybrids; source requests prove no runtime protection. | next_actions=Verify PHP extensions and their native cryptographic backends (planned)"
          },
          "locations": [
